10. I shall now advert to the decision cited by the counsel for the petitioner. Strong reliance is placed by him on the decision of the Supreme Court in
Bharat Bank v. Employees of Bharat Bank
;
Vishwamithra Press v. Workers of Vishwamitra Press
;
Durga Shankar v. Raghuraj Singh
;
Harinagar Sugar Mills v. Shyam Sundar
(AIR 1961 SC 1969);
Engineering Mazdoor Sabha v. Hind Cycles Ltd.
, ;
A.C. Companies v. P.N. Sharma
and
Jugal Kishore v. Sitamarhi Central Co-op. Bank
in support of his contention that the Board of Revenue is a Court of Judicature and it has inherent jurisdiction.
